# Contributing to OpenScanVision

First off, thank you for considering contributing to OpenScanVision! It's people like you that make this project better and help it grow. Whether you are reporting a bug, suggesting a feature, or submitting a pull request – your contribution is genuinely appreciated.

We follow the standard [GitHub flow](https://guides.github.com/introduction/flow/) for contributions. Please read this document before submitting any changes.


